WEBVTT

00:00:05.570 --> 00:00:07.010
Come on, let's hurry!

00:00:07.580 --> 00:00:08.720
Hey, don't push me!

00:00:12.790 --> 00:00:14.180
I'm looking forward to it!

00:00:14.350 --> 00:00:16.390
I wonder if we'll catch a lot...

00:00:16.680 --> 00:00:19.190
All right! I'll catch the most today!

00:00:19.190 --> 00:00:21.190
No, I won't lose to you, I'll definitely win!

00:00:21.190 --> 00:00:22.910
I won't lose to you either.

00:00:22.910 --> 00:00:24.420
What are you talking about? I'll win!

00:00:24.420 --> 00:00:25.510
I'll win!

00:00:31.770 --> 00:00:32.300
Who's that?

00:00:32.790 --> 00:00:33.650
Tsukishima.

00:00:33.770 --> 00:00:35.810
He's the son of the Minister.

00:00:36.190 --> 00:00:37.390
Kuro, you didn't know?

00:00:37.940 --> 00:00:39.070
I haven't talked to him.

00:00:39.780 --> 00:00:41.870
He's always looking at us from that spot.

00:00:42.510 --> 00:00:43.480
Should we play together?

00:00:43.840 --> 00:00:46.090
What? Don't...

00:00:46.190 --> 00:00:50.070
My mother told me before, seems like his
body is really weak.

00:00:50.180 --> 00:00:52.910
He's so weak, he'll get fever easily.

00:00:53.070 --> 00:00:56.730
And he's the Minister's child. If anything happens
we'll get into trouble.

00:00:57.160 --> 00:00:58.280
What do you mean by "anything"?

00:00:58.680 --> 00:00:59.710
Don't know.

00:01:00.660 --> 00:01:01.830
We're going on ahead.

00:01:08.420 --> 00:01:09.160
Come over!

00:01:13.750 --> 00:01:17.750
Say, if you want to play together, just say so!

00:01:18.570 --> 00:01:25.860
But... I was told that... I can't run around
like the others...

00:01:26.030 --> 00:01:27.970
If your body is weak, then train it.

00:01:28.260 --> 00:01:30.090
You're a boy, aren't you? A boy!

00:01:32.560 --> 00:01:36.100
Seya, it's fine to let him join us, right?

00:01:37.230 --> 00:01:39.490
It's fine~

00:01:40.310 --> 00:01:40.920
Alright.

00:01:41.220 --> 00:01:41.700
Huh?

00:01:42.530 --> 00:01:43.920
Then, let's go!

00:01:47.360 --> 00:01:50.710
Wait a minute, if we run this fast...

00:01:55.130 --> 00:01:56.150
It's fine!

00:01:56.900 --> 00:01:58.750
Hold on tight.

00:02:07.340 --> 00:02:08.560
<i>Tsukishima's hand was...</i>

00:02:10.100 --> 00:02:11.090
<i>...cold...</i>

00:02:12.180 --> 00:02:12.990
<i>...pale...</i>

00:02:14.320 --> 00:02:15.420
<i>...and small.</i>

00:02:38.960 --> 00:02:40.510
I'm Kuroda.

00:02:40.910 --> 00:02:41.770
Let me through.

00:02:42.710 --> 00:02:45.280
I seek appointment with Tsukishima-dono!

00:02:45.280 --> 00:02:46.350
You can't!

00:02:46.350 --> 00:02:49.420
We've received orders to not let anyone through!

00:02:50.060 --> 00:02:53.620
I have something I absolutely need to say to Tsukishima!

00:02:54.100 --> 00:02:55.130
Tsukishima...

00:03:07.750 --> 00:03:09.490
Kuroda-dono, you can't!

00:03:09.750 --> 00:03:13.020
Damn, let me through... let me through!

00:03:17.540 --> 00:03:18.720
Kuroda-dono!

00:03:50.860 --> 00:03:52.530
You look terrible.

00:03:53.720 --> 00:03:55.070
Is it alright for you to be moving around?

00:03:55.470 --> 00:03:56.800
Rather than that... you!

00:03:56.810 --> 00:03:58.460
Don't speak loudly.

00:03:59.050 --> 00:03:59.960
It's the middle of the night.

00:04:13.760 --> 00:04:16.320
Your injury... how is it?

00:04:17.880 --> 00:04:19.370
It's nothing serious.

00:04:21.380 --> 00:04:23.880
The bandages just make it look serious.

00:04:33.130 --> 00:04:34.410
How is Seya?

00:04:35.260 --> 00:04:37.060
I heard he was critically injured.

00:04:39.070 --> 00:04:40.370
His injuries are serious,

00:04:40.980 --> 00:04:43.630
but right now, he isn't in the right mental state
to speak.

00:04:45.030 --> 00:04:47.260
He isn't a weak one,

00:04:48.290 --> 00:04:50.600
I wonder what on earth did he see on the battlefield.

00:04:53.770 --> 00:04:54.570
I see.

00:04:55.730 --> 00:04:56.800
That's worrying.

00:04:57.960 --> 00:04:59.850
If only I could visit him.

00:05:02.280 --> 00:05:06.220
I heard that you're going to take full responsibility.

00:05:07.000 --> 00:05:08.840
Oh...Yeah.

00:05:09.660 --> 00:05:10.830
I'll leave the rest to you.

00:05:11.380 --> 00:05:12.920
Leave it to me?

00:05:14.470 --> 00:05:15.780
If things had gone well,

00:05:16.150 --> 00:05:18.990
I wanted the three of us to go flower-viewing again.

00:05:22.130 --> 00:05:24.730
Seems like this world doesn't move according to
our wishes.

00:05:27.120 --> 00:05:30.030
I'm really worried about Seya,

00:05:30.570 --> 00:05:32.500
so please stay by his side for me too.

00:05:33.120 --> 00:05:33.760
I'm counting on you.

00:05:37.280 --> 00:05:38.510
In your case,

00:05:38.670 --> 00:05:42.090
I'm sure you'll stay alive tenaciously and persistently...

00:05:42.550 --> 00:05:45.010
...so I'm not worried at all.

00:05:48.740 --> 00:05:50.590
What's with that scary expression?

00:05:51.510 --> 00:05:53.630
You already look like a bad person.

00:05:57.990 --> 00:05:58.940
Say,

00:05:59.380 --> 00:06:04.690
you are always snatching the best parts at the end,
aren't you?

00:06:06.000 --> 00:06:07.400
One day, in history...

00:06:07.880 --> 00:06:12.740
...it will be written down as "the Lord's life was saved by
Tsukishima's suicide" or something like that.

00:06:14.110 --> 00:06:17.290
You've turned things around really well.

00:06:18.270 --> 00:06:20.120
Kuroda, that's rude!

00:06:20.490 --> 00:06:22.120
But isn't that so!?

00:06:22.410 --> 00:06:23.270
What?

00:06:23.370 --> 00:06:27.150
Rather than the dead, the ones who live have
things tougher.

00:06:27.560 --> 00:06:28.490
What was that?

00:06:29.150 --> 00:06:31.820
Pushing the cleaning up afterwards on me selfishly...

00:06:31.950 --> 00:06:34.300
Why don't you try putting yourself in my shoes!?

00:06:34.300 --> 00:06:34.970
<i>No...</i>

00:06:35.160 --> 00:06:36.720
Kuroda, you...

00:06:36.870 --> 00:06:37.530
<i>No...</i>

00:06:37.530 --> 00:06:39.440
There are things you can say or you can't.

00:06:39.430 --> 00:06:41.480
<i>I didn't want to say such things.</i>

00:06:41.820 --> 00:06:43.600
Nobody is saying this to you,

00:06:42.840 --> 00:06:44.010
<i>But now that I'm here...</i>

00:06:43.580 --> 00:06:45.230
so I'm saying it on their behalf!

00:06:45.220 --> 00:06:46.350
<i>What I wanted to tell you...</i>

00:06:50.060 --> 00:06:51.270
<i>...is just one thing.</i>

00:06:52.490 --> 00:06:54.810
<i>What I wanted to tell you...</i>

00:06:57.820 --> 00:07:00.040
If that's all you want to tell, then go back!

00:07:00.420 --> 00:07:01.730
When did I...!

00:07:04.010 --> 00:07:04.570
Kuro...

00:07:08.750 --> 00:07:09.500
What?

00:07:09.870 --> 00:07:10.900
Wai... Kur...

00:07:21.340 --> 00:07:22.300
You...!

00:07:22.650 --> 00:07:24.300
...don't understand, do you?

00:07:24.400 --> 00:07:26.050
For the one who dies,

00:07:26.290 --> 00:07:28.950
everything ends once he's dead.

00:07:30.740 --> 00:07:33.510
He returns to the Earth and it's over. That's all.

00:07:34.560 --> 00:07:37.710
The ones who get troubled are the ones who
are left behind.

00:07:38.050 --> 00:07:41.560
We have to do the cleaning up after you leave, and
settle other matters...

00:07:42.200 --> 00:07:44.450
Even after the physical things are settled,

00:07:44.570 --> 00:07:47.470
there are still terrible things like memories which remain.

00:07:47.860 --> 00:07:50.400
To be frank, that is extremely troubling!

00:07:51.210 --> 00:07:53.420
Don't talk of such things while smiling so frivolously.

00:07:54.170 --> 00:07:56.040
If you're going to die anyway,

00:07:56.140 --> 00:07:59.480
take my memories with you before you die!

00:08:01.100 --> 00:08:01.980
In that case,

00:08:02.980 --> 00:08:04.790
I'll cause more trouble for you!

00:08:05.490 --> 00:08:06.840
Since long ago,

00:08:06.840 --> 00:08:09.950
you've always been making fun of me.

00:08:10.070 --> 00:08:12.490
Although you've always listened to what Seya said,

00:08:12.790 --> 00:08:14.510
you never did that for me.

00:08:14.840 --> 00:08:15.940
Someone like you...

00:08:17.330 --> 00:08:19.550
Hate me is what you want to say, right?

00:08:20.170 --> 00:08:21.610
Don't say it before me!

00:08:22.040 --> 00:08:23.780
You're always like that...

00:08:24.120 --> 00:08:25.350
Doing this to me...

00:08:26.380 --> 00:08:29.060
I hate you too!

00:08:29.060 --> 00:08:32.470
Shut up! I really hate you...

00:08:34.010 --> 00:08:35.080
Someone like you...

00:08:44.370 --> 00:08:45.190
Tsukishima.

00:08:50.250 --> 00:08:51.960
Stop it... Kuroda...

00:08:53.300 --> 00:08:54.330
Let go.

00:08:56.580 --> 00:08:57.130
That's...

00:08:58.450 --> 00:08:59.090
...enough.

00:09:02.570 --> 00:09:05.180
Both me and you should stop talking.

00:09:17.550 --> 00:09:18.770
<i>When morning comes,</i>

00:09:22.890 --> 00:09:25.570
<i>the everyday life we've had until now will disappear...</i>

00:09:29.980 --> 00:09:30.700
<i>That's why,</i>

00:09:31.630 --> 00:09:34.160
<i>this everyday life we've taken for granted...</i>

00:09:36.630 --> 00:09:38.620
<i>I want to burn it in my mind...</i>

00:09:41.770 --> 00:09:44.050
<i>Burn it into a indelible scar.</i>

00:09:48.400 --> 00:09:49.630
<i>Even when morning comes,</i>

00:09:54.100 --> 00:09:58.910
<i>I'll just keep on breathing like usual.</i>

00:10:04.560 --> 00:10:05.930
<i>I won't cry.</i>

00:10:14.990 --> 00:10:18.460
<i>Why is there a need to cry?</i>

00:10:43.800 --> 00:10:46.960
I heard that Minister Tsukishima committed suicide.

00:10:47.210 --> 00:10:50.150
He was still so young, how pitiful.

00:10:51.730 --> 00:10:56.020
But if our Lord's life can be saved by doing that,
isn't it a given?

00:10:56.080 --> 00:10:57.360
That's true.

00:10:57.630 --> 00:10:58.280
Yeah.

00:11:01.110 --> 00:11:05.190
Well, thanks to him, the clan is saved for now.

00:11:05.520 --> 00:11:08.300
If you think about it, wasn't that his wish too?

00:11:19.690 --> 00:11:21.050
Is that so?

00:11:21.200 --> 00:11:24.010
I thought he just died while being involved
unwittingly though.

00:13:17.550 --> 00:13:18.630
Kuroda!

00:13:19.550 --> 00:13:21.110
Finally found you!

00:13:22.620 --> 00:13:23.630
Seya?

00:13:24.680 --> 00:13:26.920
You've aged.

00:13:27.320 --> 00:13:29.770
There's a limit to how much you can make others worried!

00:13:29.770 --> 00:13:31.390
Where were you until now?

00:13:31.710 --> 00:13:34.780
If you're going to go missing, do it after you tell me
your whereabouts!

00:13:34.910 --> 00:13:36.180
What's with that?

00:13:36.540 --> 00:13:40.410
I've gotten to understand how important it is to be
trained in a skill.

00:13:40.910 --> 00:13:44.110
Be it electrical repairs or watch repairs, I'll do anything.

00:13:44.110 --> 00:13:45.690
And I have a payment system too.

00:13:46.210 --> 00:13:49.380
Thanks to that, I can still live normally even after giving
up my sword.

00:13:50.690 --> 00:13:52.520
Goodness, you're really...

00:13:52.960 --> 00:13:54.960
Oh sorry, was there another visitor?

00:14:01.470 --> 00:14:02.860
Tsukishi...

00:14:04.320 --> 00:14:06.010
Kuroda, you...

00:14:11.610 --> 00:14:13.330
I showed it to you long back,

00:14:14.010 --> 00:14:18.340
it's a doll that'll grow up to become like a human
if you give it love.

00:14:19.420 --> 00:14:23.220
Even though this is still a prototype, wouldn't you say
it's going pretty well?

00:14:24.330 --> 00:14:26.720
Doll? This one?

00:14:26.930 --> 00:14:28.620
It still can't speak though.

00:14:28.620 --> 00:14:30.340
Can this doll speak?

00:14:30.690 --> 00:14:32.440
I've set it up to be that way.

00:14:33.300 --> 00:14:35.510
Even though it's my love,

00:14:35.950 --> 00:14:38.020
I wonder how much it feels.

00:14:38.360 --> 00:14:40.200
We won't know until we see the results.

00:14:41.420 --> 00:14:45.710
If this goes well, I think it'll sell for a lot though.

00:14:46.760 --> 00:14:48.440
Shall I give one to you too?

00:14:48.810 --> 00:14:50.110
It's quite interesting.

00:14:50.110 --> 00:14:51.260
Kuroda!

00:14:52.580 --> 00:14:55.400
Even if you do such things, Tsukishima won't come back.

00:15:00.930 --> 00:15:02.600
Are you an idiot!?

00:15:02.650 --> 00:15:07.230
Did you think I'm making a replacement because I can't
forget about Tsukishima?

00:15:07.960 --> 00:15:11.950
Don't worry. Unfortunately, I'm not such a delicate person.

00:15:12.210 --> 00:15:15.990
Even if I made someone like him, we'd probably just
quarrel again.

00:15:15.990 --> 00:15:17.100
Kuroda!

00:15:17.550 --> 00:15:18.860
Kuroda-san.

00:15:21.170 --> 00:15:24.030
You've received a call from someone from
Yotsuya Corporation.

00:15:24.280 --> 00:15:25.170
Sorry.

00:15:25.560 --> 00:15:31.320
There are quite a few people who heard about this doll from
somewhere and want it.

00:15:33.940 --> 00:15:35.160
That's how it is,

00:15:36.020 --> 00:15:38.060
so I'm not short of money. Don't worry.

00:15:40.320 --> 00:15:41.200
I'll come again.

00:15:42.110 --> 00:15:45.280
Everything is fine with me, worry more about yourself.

00:15:45.740 --> 00:15:48.070
You have the face of a death god.

00:15:49.910 --> 00:15:52.480
Don't you agree, prototype-kun?

00:16:04.400 --> 00:16:07.870
<i>You're the one who's been tied down by the past, Seya.</i>

00:16:11.890 --> 00:16:14.810
<i>The passage of time is a fearsome thing.</i>

00:16:16.360 --> 00:16:23.200
<i>These days, I can only vaguely remember Tsukishima's face.</i>

00:16:24.670 --> 00:16:29.360
<i>There's no way someone like me can make a replacement
of Tsukishima.</i>

00:16:29.850 --> 00:16:31.420
<i>It's too far-fetched.</i>

00:16:37.760 --> 00:16:41.230
Wow, it bloomed well this year too.

00:16:46.730 --> 00:16:47.580
Did you know?

00:16:48.740 --> 00:16:54.020
Cherry blossoms are at their best on the night just before
their buds bloom.

00:16:56.050 --> 00:16:58.440
It'll look like a mist of pink.

00:17:01.650 --> 00:17:02.910
Hey! Hey!

00:17:12.480 --> 00:17:13.720
Well, forget it.

00:17:14.610 --> 00:17:16.180
The kid's just playing.

00:17:22.580 --> 00:17:24.590
What, are you giving it to me?

00:17:29.690 --> 00:17:36.670
Wind...blow...ing...

00:17:41.330 --> 00:17:42.140
<i>It can't be!</i>

00:17:44.200 --> 00:17:46.430
<i>He learned to speak!</i>

00:17:47.320 --> 00:17:47.770
Mo...

00:17:48.750 --> 00:17:50.330
That's right. Slowly.

00:17:51.280 --> 00:17:55.260
Mo-mor-morning...saw it...

00:17:55.780 --> 00:17:58.110
Bro-broken...

00:17:59.470 --> 00:18:02.010
Good for re-planting...

00:18:02.990 --> 00:18:08.820
Y-You...like...flowers...

00:18:10.570 --> 00:18:13.850
That's...why...

00:18:20.330 --> 00:18:20.960
For you.

00:18:33.920 --> 00:18:36.040
Why...?

00:18:40.460 --> 00:18:41.470
Why?

00:18:43.530 --> 00:18:46.450
<i>Those were the first words he spoke.</i>

00:18:47.960 --> 00:18:51.640
<i>Hybrid Child is a reflection of its owner.</i>

00:18:57.840 --> 00:19:01.230
<i>What in me was he reflecting?</i>

00:19:04.590 --> 00:19:09.060
<i>What did I give you?</i>

00:19:17.870 --> 00:19:24.410
<i>That pale, small and cold hand.</i>

00:19:25.260 --> 00:19:31.400
<i>No matter how much we ran, Tsukishima's hand stayed cold.</i>

00:19:32.910 --> 00:19:39.000
<i>That's why I was in a hurry to warm him up quickly,</i>

00:19:40.650 --> 00:19:44.450
<i>not letting him go so that he won't trip.</i>

00:19:52.270 --> 00:19:53.440
<i>Always.</i>

00:19:58.960 --> 00:20:03.600
<i>I'll probably spend the rest of my life creating,</i>

00:20:04.810 --> 00:20:07.330
<i>even while knowing that it's impossible.</i>

00:20:11.210 --> 00:20:12.810
<i>I love him.</i>

00:20:13.840 --> 00:20:17.080
<i>Nothing less or more than that.</i>

00:20:17.440 --> 00:20:19.560
<i>Just from the bottom of my heart,</i>

00:20:20.690 --> 00:20:24.540
<i>more than anything, towards him...</i>

00:20:26.360 --> 00:20:33.720
<i>The only things left are regrets, reminiscence and the
overflowing emotions of love.</i>

00:20:54.110 --> 00:20:55.640
<i>The smell of summer grass...</i>

00:21:05.220 --> 00:21:06.990
<i>White clouds with the slight breeze...</i>

00:21:11.470 --> 00:21:12.970
<i>No matter how many years pass,</i>

00:21:17.100 --> 00:21:19.760
<i>I am alone.</i>

00:21:23.130 --> 00:21:28.020
Tsumetai sono taion wo kanjiteru

00:21:23.130 --> 00:21:28.020
Feeling the coolness of your body temperature

00:21:28.020 --> 00:21:32.630
Kasanaru kage ni mo himitsu madotte

00:21:28.020 --> 00:21:32.630
Even the overlapping shadows hide secrets

00:21:41.850 --> 00:21:45.810
Hitotsu, Hitotsu

00:21:41.850 --> 00:21:45.810
One, One

00:21:46.590 --> 00:21:50.470
Kasoe tsujuketeru

00:21:46.590 --> 00:21:50.470
I keep on counting

00:21:51.100 --> 00:22:00.250
Nando yoru wo koete kitaro ga

00:21:51.100 --> 00:22:00.250
How many times have I survived the night

00:22:00.930 --> 00:22:05.090
Kagami wo shino sekai atsume

00:22:00.930 --> 00:22:05.090
In the mirror, gather the world and cage it in

00:22:05.090 --> 00:22:09.760
Tashikameyowo nakusanai yoni

00:22:05.090 --> 00:22:09.760
So as to not lose it

00:22:09.760 --> 00:22:18.700
Sono koe mo nanimo ka mo futari no mono dakara

00:22:09.760 --> 00:22:18.700
And that voice, everything that is anything belongs to the two of us

00:22:19.060 --> 00:22:23.750
Youna ma mayo mama sugu wakatte

00:22:19.060 --> 00:22:23.750
Facing it straight on, just like in our dreams

00:22:23.770 --> 00:22:28.400
Kao wa takusanno kotoba tsuzutte

00:22:23.770 --> 00:22:28.400
Facing you with constant words flowing

00:22:28.400 --> 00:22:31.410
Kowo mo kure nakute mo

00:22:28.400 --> 00:22:31.410
You needn't do this just because

00:22:31.410 --> 00:22:37.740
Doko made mo yukimashou issho ni

00:22:31.410 --> 00:22:37.740
I'll go anywhere with you, together

00:22:58.330 --> 00:23:03.280
Hirogari yuku kanjowo oboetera

00:22:58.330 --> 00:23:03.280
The emotions that spread inside me

00:23:03.280 --> 00:23:07.900
Eien ni mo mita negai wo motte

00:23:03.280 --> 00:23:07.900
will stay with me forever along with my hopes

00:23:16.920 --> 00:23:21.840
Tsumetai sono taion wo kanjite

00:23:16.920 --> 00:23:21.840
Feeling the coolness of your body temperature

00:23:21.840 --> 00:23:26.420
Chiisai hana he to omoitakushite

00:23:21.840 --> 00:23:26.420
Entrusting our feelings to little flowers

00:23:26.420 --> 00:23:29.550
